{%- set states = doctors | flatMap("state") | unique -%}
{%- set eStates = emerge | flatMap("states") | unique -%}
{%- set eTypes = emerge | flatMap("type") | unique -%}

<p><a class="btn btn-soft btn-sm" href="#emerge-australia-directory">Emerge directory ({{ emerge.length }})</a> <a class="btn btn-soft btn-sm" href="#gps-recommended-by-griffith-university-ncned">NCNED list ({{ doctors.length }})</a></p>

<h2 id="emerge-australia-directory">Emerge Australia directory</h2>
<p>Emerge Australia, the national ME/CFS organisation, keeps a directory of GPs, medical clinics, allied health professionals and support services that have told Emerge they see people with ME/CFS or Long COVID. Emerge notes that it doesn't endorse or certify the clinicians listed. Select a listing to see the full details on Emerge's site.</p>

<div data-filterable>
  <div class="filters" role="search" aria-label="Filter the Emerge directory" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr))">
    <div>
      <label for="e-text">Search by name, suburb or postcode</label>
      <input id="e-text" type="search" data-filter="etext" placeholder="e.g. Geelong, 4217, psychologist">
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="e-state">State or territory</label>
      <select id="e-state" data-filter="estate">
        <option value="">All</option>
        {% for s in eStates %}<option>{{ s }}</option>{% endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="e-type">Type</label>
      <select id="e-type" data-filter="etype">
        <option value="">All types</option>
        {% for t in eTypes %}<option>{{ t }}</option>{% endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="filter-count" data-count data-noun="listings" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top:0">
    {% for e in emerge %}
    <article class="item-card" data-item data-estate="{{ e.states | join('|') }}" data-etype="{{ e.type | join('|') }}" style="padding:1rem 1.1rem">
      <div class="item-top">
        {% if e.national %}<span class="chip chip-au">Australia-wide</span>{% else %}{% for s in e.states %}<span class="chip chip-au">{{ s }}</span>{% endfor %}{% endif %}
        {% for t in e.type %}<span class="chip">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      <h3 style="font-size:1.08rem;margin:.1rem 0 .3rem"><a href="{{ e.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ e.name }}</a></h3>
      {% if e.address %}<p class="small muted" style="margin:0 0 .3rem">{{ e.address }}</p>{% endif %}
      {% if e.description %}<p class="small" style="margin:0 0 .3rem">{{ e.description }}</p>{% endif %}
      <p class="small" style="margin:0">{% if e.phone %}<a href="tel:{{ e.phone | replace(' ', '') | replace('(', '') | replace(')', '') }}">{{ e.phone }}</a> · {% endif %}<a href="{{ e.url }}" rel="noopener">View on Emerge ↗</a></p>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="callout callout-note" data-empty hidden><p>No listings match those filters. <button class="btn btn-sm btn-soft" type="button" data-reset>Clear filters</button></p></div>
  <p class="muted small">Directory data from <a href="https://directory.emerge.org.au/" rel="noopener">directory.emerge.org.au</a>, collected {{ site.lastReviewed | readableDate }}. For the most current listings, search Emerge's directory directly.</p>
</div>

<h2 id="gps-recommended-by-griffith-university-ncned">GPs recommended by Griffith University (NCNED)</h2>
<p>Griffith University's National Centre for Neuroimmunology and Emerging Diseases shared this list of GPs in September 2026. It's mostly Gold Coast, Brisbane and northern NSW. Several prescribe low-dose naltrexone (LDN).</p>
<div data-filterable>
  <div class="filters" role="search" aria-label="Filter NCNED doctors" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr))">
    <div>
      <label for="d-text">Search by name or suburb</label>
      <input id="d-text" type="search" data-filter="text" placeholder="e.g. Southport, Graham">
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="d-state">State</label>
      <select id="d-state" data-filter="state">
        <option value="">All states</option>
        {% for s in states %}<option>{{ s }}</option>{% endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>
    <div>
      <label for="d-tag">Show</label>
      <select id="d-tag" data-filter="tag">
        <option value="">All doctors</option>
        <option value="ldn">LDN prescribers</option>
        <option value="sees">Sees ME/CFS & Long COVID</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="filter-count" data-count data-noun="doctors" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top:0">
    {% for d in doctors %}
    <article class="item-card" data-item data-state="{{ d.state }}" data-tag="{% if d.ldn %}ldn{% endif %}|{% if d.sees %}sees{% endif %}">
      <div class="item-top">
        <span class="chip chip-au">{{ d.state }}</span>
        {% if d.ldn %}<span class="chip chip-recruiting">LDN</span>{% endif %}
        {% if d.sees %}<span class="chip chip-soon">ME/CFS & Long COVID</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem">{{ d.name }}</h3>
      <p style="margin:0">{% if d.practice %}{{ d.practice }}<br>{% endif %}<span class="muted">{{ d.suburb }}, {{ d.state }}</span></p>
      {% if d.note %}<p class="item-note">{{ d.note }}</p>{% endif %}
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="callout callout-note" data-empty hidden><p>No doctors match those filters. <button class="btn btn-sm btn-soft" type="button" data-reset>Clear filters</button></p></div>
</div>

{% markdown %}
{% callout "warn", "Please read" %}
The NCNED list was shared by Griffith University's National Centre for Neuroimmunology and Emerging Diseases in September 2026. **Neither list is an endorsement** by this site, Griffith University or Emerge Australia, and it may go out of date. Doctors move practices and books close, so **call ahead** before booking. Search the practice name for current phone numbers and opening hours.
{% endcallout %}

## Tips for your first appointment

- **Book a long appointment.** ME/CFS can't be covered in 10 minutes.
- **Bring a one-page summary:** when you got sick, what triggered it, your main symptoms, what makes them worse, tests you've had and medications you take.
- **Bring evidence:** a few weeks of [symptom tracking](/living/wearables/#a-simple-daily-log) and your [lean test numbers](/living/orthostatic-intolerance/#the-home-lean-test-nasa-10-minute-lean-test).
- **Use our [GP script](/treatment/testing/#a-script-for-your-gp-appointment)** for tests and referrals to ask about.
- **Asking about LDN?** See [what the evidence says](/treatment/medications/#low-dose-naltrexone-ldn) first. It's cheap and generally safe, but not a sure thing.
- **Telehealth** can save a lot of energy for follow-up appointments. Ask whether the doctor offers it.

## Finding a doctor elsewhere in Australia

Many doctors across Australia can help with ME/CFS. Good places to look:

- **Emerge Australia:** their [online directory](https://directory.emerge.org.au/) is listed above, and their nurses can also help. Call [1800 865 321](tel:1800865321) (press 1) or visit [emerge.org.au](https://emerge.org.au).
- **ME/CFS Australia** and state-based ME/CFS groups often know local doctors.
- **Compounding pharmacies** that make LDN can often tell you which local doctors prescribe it.
- **Support groups:** other patients are often the best source of local recommendations.

